  "rationale": "Metabolism sublibrary (361 genes, 3,610 guides; no non-targeting guides) of the in vivo Toxoplasma CRISPR study. RH tachyzoites passaged in vitro (P4, 1 library) and in vivo through WT mice (WT_*, 8 libraries) and Ifngr1-/- mice (KO_*, 7 libraries). In vivo libraries are bottlenecked (top 1% 19-41%), so median_ratio totals and only between-arm comparisons are interpretable. Primary WT vs KO (Table S3A p.value_WTvsKO) finds IFN-gamma-dependent fitness genes; secondary P4 vs WT (one in vitro library vs 8 WT) gives in vivo fitness. No neutral controls, so no calibration/control null.",
